Patch 0007-quiet-boot.patch for vLLM, base commit 77154ca6116ae34cbfe314beef1016bde9b63989 (vllm/vllm-openai:nightly-77154ca6116ae34cbfe314beef1016bde9b63989).
What: Stops the load-time warning for dtype casts that are exact (the checkpoint's 37 BF16 tensors loaded into FP32 parameters) and keeps it for casts that can change a value; registers the PLE gather environment variables so vLLM does not warn that they are unknown.
Upstream: no vLLM PR. written for this recipe.
This file modifies vLLM (Apache-2.0); the vLLM copyright and SPDX lines in the files it changes are kept.

